<title>USA: Visioneer adopts shareholder rights plan.</title>
<headline>Visioneer adopts shareholder rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Visioneer Inc said Thursday its board of directors adopted a stockholder rights plan on October 23, 1996.</p>
<p>Commenting on its adoption, Michael McConnell, President and CEO stated, &quot;The rights are designed to protect and maximize the value of stockholders' interest in Visioneer.&quot;</p>
<p>The distribution of the rights will be made to stockholders of record on November 11, 1996.</p>
</text>
